[cot:thought] components are planned: a quarterly tape with dual-axis velocity, dwell, and revenue/carload index; a carrier snapshot by Class I; a terminal dwell lag chart; a scatter plot of velocity versus revenue per carload by quarter; an AAR-style carload mix panel; headline statistics; and visual markers. Phase 1 will be committed next.
